me","entry_revision_identity":"960641aa4af2e44afbf867f1266d28c051e8c5ddf3ad4e0ed8ea7228a98d8aa5","logical_entry_identity":"f7b2a63aadfbb82baf5ad78d882f8ddc95a0f54bcf905ddb2a9798fa4f8cca9f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Instantly call all of your bloated oozes to your aid.\n\t\tIf you have less than the maximum number of oozes allowed by the Mitosis talent, up to %d will be created with %d life (%d%% of the maximum life allowed by Mitosis).\n\t\tEach ooze created will form near a random foe in sight (no more than one ooze per target) and grab its attention.\n\t\tThis will then allow you to channel a melee attack through your ooze to its target, doing %d%% weapon damage (as Acid).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"立刻召集你所有的浮肿软泥怪前来助战。\n\t\t如果当前软泥怪数量低于“有丝分裂”技能允许的上限，最多会生成 %d 只，每只拥有 %d 点生命（相当于“有丝分裂”所允许最大生命值的 %d%%）。\n\t\t每只软泥怪会移动到视野内某个随机敌人附近（每个目标最多一只），并吸引其注意。\n\t\t随后，你会通过软泥怪对其目标发动一次近战攻击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害（转化为酸性伤害）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"18f756d0e386c8c55c6f90181d52df7cbb5da8141a337b3d7277432567599b03","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"960c87ba33a0f13513c773c26c595ab08d5c4be4b80e9628747e56f863fba50c","logical_entry_identity":"6ce0afa8e72f7509067a12f406884c1317ff1128611eb428f8ee28097894f4ed","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"huge","source_tag":"_t","target":"庞大"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e6fd250a58f8d3b386b7fd98efb88c630f6edbaa0b83fb7a45ea6d6e46cc907f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"960e45bdab905fc567abe0c4f75820877d3ecf2bbf47c145233b05a10a2c530a","logical_entry_identity":"f2feb0f97710d34d034fb04e70ec32cff97dd3e979be559d6497b57b1c6f8343","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reset all the interface?","source_tag":"_t","target":"重置所有用户界面？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5f5d17651ab51633fb98c0ea9bf444e909b513b93a3f5232c309919769d00bc9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"960e73c1f7cb24bdbf65cb192ab456f3cd358fbcbee68a867863dc45fc724e72","logical_entry_identity":"645d2b362052245e9ee64795b2481c